  "item": [
    {
      "id": "e8880c5a-225e-45b1-99f7-b3213666d817",
      "name": "Tag Routes",
      "description": {
        "content": "<span className='text-important'>**Note:** Tag is deprecated. We recommend transitioning to [Enhanced Tag](#tag/Enhanced-Tag-Routes).</span>\n\n~~The Tags data scope includes tags that Oura users enter within the Oura mobile app. Tags are a growing list of activities, environment factors, symptoms, emotions, and other aspects that provide broader context into what's happening with users beyond the objective data generated by the Oura Ring.~~\n\n~~[More information on tag translations](https://cloud.ouraring.com/edu/tag-translations)~~",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
